Z||000003||DRH||05-11-2000||01:19 PM||||- The deal does not always go thru at the price you see. I have seen things re-listed several times.<P>- People are unaware of the retail and internet sites and think the auction is the only chance they have.<P>- People tend to believe <B>anything</B> if it is marketed correctly. It seems <B>everything</B> has suddenly become collectable.<P>- People get very competitive at auctions. I went to an auction for a shop that was going out of business. Some things like jack stands, floor jacks and some tools were going for quite a bit more that they would cost new!!!<P>Just my .02...||||reg||1
Z||000004||Spyder||05-11-2000||01:34 PM||||I am amazed at the fake things on ebay.  I work in retail and I see some items that are fake, selling for the same price or more than the real items. Amazed. <BR>I haven’t seen anything that I’ve wanted that was cheap there.<BR>There are some people that post stuff and then use an alias to bump up the bidding.<BR>It’s sad that some people don’t know any better.||||reg||1
